# Files kept in the GitHub repo but left OUT of the published registry
# package. gitignore syntax; the registry starts from the git-tracked file
# list and removes anything matched here.
#
# The demo animations are ~15.5 MB of an 18.6 MB package. They exist for the
# README, which GitHub renders from the repo — nothing in the running node
# loads them, so shipping them to every installer is pure download weight.
# assets/icon.png is NOT excluded: pyproject's Icon field points at it.
assets/*.gif

# Screenshots, same reasoning — README-only.
assets/anatomy.png
assets/style-tuning.png
# …and the hero shot, which lives at the repo root rather than in assets/ and
# so was missed by the rule above. 410 KB per install for a picture only the
# GitHub page renders.
EPE_Node.png

# Dev-only files that have no business in an installed node.
*.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.vscode/
.idea/
*.diff
*.patch
*.bak
backup/
build_help.py
test_*.py
